@prefix : <urn:x:> .
@prefix cascade: <https://ns.cascadeprotocol.org/cascade#> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:subject a cascade:Subject .

:a a cascade:ProblemOrDiagnosis .
